  "ELEC-NCERT-11-SA-025": { status: "hold", note: "third audit (review checklist): Step 2 says 'work done per unit time per unit charge × charge per second'. This is scientifically garbled. V is work per unit charge, and P = VI is that times charge per unit time." },
