  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-001": { status: "hold", note: "judge/audit: Step 2 is inconsistent: 'each O contributes 4 e⁻ (2 to bonding, 4 as lone pairs)'. Each O has 6 valence electrons, with 2 in each shared bond pair and 4 as lone pairs." },
  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-002": { status: "publish", hash: "22aeac1b95771181", note: "book check MATCH, text faithful; syllabus IN (guard); blind solve agrees; judge + text/steps audit clean; second audit clean; third audit (review checklist) clean or kept by its written rule" },
  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-003": { status: "hold", note: "third audit (review checklist): The names isopentane, neopentane, 2-methylbutane and 2,2-dimethylpropane are not in the NCERT chapter. The chapter only shows the butane isomers and the general idea of branched chains." },
  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-004": { status: "publish", hash: "616bdf5f0451e52a", note: "book check MATCH, text faithful; syllabus IN (guard); blind solve agrees; judge + text/steps audit clean; second audit clean; third audit (review checklist) clean or kept by its written rule" },
  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-005": { status: "publish", hash: "85da007df66a6906", note: "book check MATCH, text faithful; syllabus IN (guard); blind solve agrees; judge + text/steps audit clean; second audit clean; third audit (review checklist) clean or kept by its written rule" },
  "CARB-NCERT-4-SA-001": { status: "ref-mismatch", note: "book check MISMATCH (found at In-text Qn 4 (after §4.2)): The box after §4.2 runs from Q1 to Q5 across two pages, and this is its Q4. There is no question box after §4.3 with this question. The row's text matches the book's four compounds plus the bromopentane isomer footnote." },
  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-006": { status: "ref-mismatch", note: "book check MISMATCH (found at In-text Qn 5 (after §4.2)): This is Q5 of the box after §4.2. The book's (ii) and (iii) are drawn structures, and their text is missing from the extraction. The row's text is garbled: '(ii) H–C≡C–H (with formula HCHO … alternate read)' and '(iii) CH₃–CH₂–CHO' are invented or uncertain. The row carries no real structures for (ii) and (iii), so the question cannot be answered faithfully. Only (i) CH₃–CH₂–Br is confirmed." },
  "CARB-NCERT-4-SA-002": { status: "ref-mismatch", note: "book check MISMATCH (found at In-text Qn 1 (after §4.3)): The ethanol-to-ethanoic acid question is Q1 of the box after §4.3, not §4.4. Wording matches." },
  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-007": { status: "ref-mismatch", note: "book check MISMATCH (found at In-text Qn 2 (after §4.3)): The ethyne welding question is Q2 of the box after §4.3. There is no box after §4.4.1. Wording matches." },
  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-008": { status: "ref-mismatch", note: "book check MISMATCH (found at In-text Qn 1 (after §4.4)): Distinguishing an alcohol from a carboxylic acid is Q1 of the box after §4.4, which ends after §4.4.2. Wording matches." },
