  "CARB-NCERT-4-VSA-014": { status: "hold", note: "judge/audit: The litmus result is right, but the key text has a drafting error: 'acidic ROOH + strong base NaOH' uses the wrong formula (should be RCOOH, a weak acid). Clean up the wording." },
